body:
Watch | Aam Aadmi Party Delhi President Saurabh Bhardwaj said, "So why do we need to reach Jantar Mantar on October 2? Where all of Gen-Z and many organisations are arriving, why do we need to go there? Any government works for this reason, does public good for this reason, that if they don't work for the public's welfare, the public will throw them out of power by not voting for them... We need to reach Jantar Mantar on October 2 in a peaceful manner. Peaceful is very important, why? Because we've seen many times that the police send troublemakers in plain clothes into the crowd, who try to spread chaos and violence there. The police send them sometimes. Identify such people and immediately hand them over to the uniformed police officers..."

@AamAadmiParty | @Saurabh_MLAgk | @AAPDelhi 

(Source: Saurabh Bharadwaj / X)

