The situation at Lovely Professional University has spiralled out of control, exposing the complete failure of the Punjab Government, police and administration.

Reports of sharp weapons and walkie-talkies being recovered raise a serious question: Who allowed such weapons to enter the campus, and who is accountable?

@ArvindKejriwal, @msisodia and @harjotbains reached Jantar Mantar in Delhi, but have still not reached LPU, where Punjab’s students are facing an alarming situation.

Punjab’s children deserve safety, not silence. Where is the Bhagwant Mann Government when they need it most?
@INCPunjab

@AugadhBhudeva Brother @AugadhBhudeva I just have one question, why is @PMOIndia 
@HMOIndia allowing these Anarchists with zero constitutional authority so much of freedom to do and speak as they please?
It gives an impression of weakness! It's demoralized genuine followers &amp; voters of PM Modi.

Extended my full solidarity today to the Cockroach Janata Party and social activist Sonam Wangchuk at Jantar Mantar, Delhi, as they lead the protest demanding the resignation of Union Minister Dharmendra Pradhan. With millions of students’ lives at stake, our youth have taken to the streets. The Central Government has no alternative but to concede to their demands.

