@abhijeet_dipke @SauravDassss @AshutoshRanka SAAR ab to non biased opinion hai naa , if you are a student oriented organisation you shouldn't and can't involve school going college going career oriented students, you should not drag them into these protests instead you should create a atmosphere and environment for them to study well , you should motivate them , you should collectively with opposition sit with government and do whatever needed for their benefits, instead you are creating a havoc in their student life , turmoil in the country, uncertainty in their exams schedules . 

To all students I say whatever is happening in your life is unknowingly affecting your career , unemployed hona alag but hai but you are being pushed into the path of being uneducated. 

You are being made a scapegoat your image your career your relationship with parents , your goal , your peace everything is being hijacjed by these outfits . 

Bhagat singh sacrificed himself for all of us but we are being sacrificed entire indian students are being sacrificed just to  satisfiie few vested persons political ambitions and ego .... I also urge @narendramodi
@AmitShah hoping for a decisive government, few 100's and 1000's ke adulting ke chkkar mai why push our innocent kids our students @grok pls verfy with numbers what is the total no of students nursery  till class 12 in india , compare in percentage to the students out in protest i believe total no of students are 24 crore , 247 million and as per data of jantar mantar protest 30,000 student or so called student came if we take into consideration this figure then it's 
0.0121% 1 in 8,230 , why should they dictate terms to us , I urge government of India to ban this meme group for the greater issue of the actual students.

@grok pls verify with facts 

BEWAREE !!!!

